# Repository hygiene
- Keep generated outputs out of source folders unless intentionally versioned.
- Never modify production releases in place; create a new version.
- Use UTF-8, Unix line endings, and portable relative paths.
- Do not run destructive shell commands without a clearly scoped target.
- Preserve user-authored research and strategy files during installation and upgrades.
